ack":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/6685|#6685 --allow-net=:8080 broken\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/6685|#6685 --allow-net=:8080 broken\u003e","text":"If any code uses shorthand notation:\n\n```\nimport { serve } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/std/http/server.ts\u003e\"\nconst PORT = 8080\nserve(`:${PORT}`)\n```\n\nthen any variant of\n\n```\ndeno run --allow-net=:8080 server.ts\ndeno run --allow-net=localhost:8080 server.ts\ndeno run --allow-net=0.0.0.0:8080 server.ts\ndeno run --allow-net=127.0.0.1:8080 server.ts\n\n```\n\nfails.\n\nUnfortunately, a lot of libraries in x use this pattern which makes locking down permissions impossible without forking all those libraries.","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"bug, good first issue, cli","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"6","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno|denoland/deno\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1594187540}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gz3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08b97146-92d1-4956-addd-9f70993aecb7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まったく詳しいわけではないので、説明用のアヒルちゃん役として役に立ったのだろうと思うことにするw","ts":"1632635743.361800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U8C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dd796be-53ba-4a97-a794-885605b914ab","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ありがとうございます、とりあえず使わない方向でやろうと思います","ts":"1632635710.361000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QUoB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"722cd142-a44b-457a-b739-613f09e66897","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"やはり仕様かー…","ts":"163263566